    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stars of the Valkyrie</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/9b56eeaabc9273750351586c4e9f360b.poster.avif?t=1743263192\" width=400 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/9b56eeaabc9273750351586c4e9f360b.webm?t=1743263192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/9b56eeaabc9273750351586c4e9f360b.mp4?t=1743263192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through space shooting down/dodging asteroids and enemy ships, and avoid harming transports. Be careful as giant cruisers will try to shoot you down. Score big and you may find yourself in the top scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Runner Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/1572d7eb3160aaef54429a5fe257c0ee.poster.avif?t=1743263192\" width=400 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/1572d7eb3160aaef54429a5fe257c0ee.webm?t=1743263192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/1572d7eb3160aaef54429a5fe257c0ee.mp4?t=1743263192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play an endless runner like you would an old school style arcade game. With a unique nine lane system that puts action in 3D like never before.\u00a0Get a top score and brag to your friends that you're the best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique nine lane movement</strong>, giving you more freedom to dodge and shoot through space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoreboard</strong>, see where you rank against the rest of the world. Can you make the top ten?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing<strong> Stars of the Valkyrie</strong>\u00a0you will receive a supporters icon on the top scores and fly through the stars in the supporters ship.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stars of the Valkyrie</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/9b56eeaabc9273750351586c4e9f360b.poster.avif?t=1743263192\" width=400 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/9b56eeaabc9273750351586c4e9f360b.webm?t=1743263192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/9b56eeaabc9273750351586c4e9f360b.mp4?t=1743263192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through space shooting down/dodging asteroids and enemy ships, and avoid harming transports. Be careful as giant cruisers will try to shoot you down. Score big and you may find yourself in the top scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Runner Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/1572d7eb3160aaef54429a5fe257c0ee.poster.avif?t=1743263192\" width=400 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/1572d7eb3160aaef54429a5fe257c0ee.webm?t=1743263192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554980/extras/1572d7eb3160aaef54429a5fe257c0ee.mp4?t=1743263192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play an endless runner like you would an old school style arcade game. With a unique nine lane system that puts action in 3D like never before.\u00a0Get a top score and brag to your friends that you're the best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique nine lane movement</strong>, giving you more freedom to dodge and shoot through space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoreboard</strong>, see where you rank against the rest of the world. Can you make the top ten?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing<strong> Stars of the Valkyrie</strong>\u00a0you will receive a supporters icon on the top scores and fly through the stars in the supporters ship.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Endless runner action has never been more dynamic with a unique 3D movement system. Fly through the stars in this Neo-Arcade game as you dodge asteroids shoot down enemies ships and protect transport ships. When you have finished upload and compare your score against the best from around the world.",
